Design Employee Analytics Dashboard Cards
1. Introduction

After establishing the Employee Analytics Dashboard foundation, the next phase focused on designing employee summary cards to provide a quick overview of each employee's work statistics. The dashboard cards were designed to present essential performance metrics in a clean, responsive, and user-friendly format, enabling managers and administrators to monitor employee activity efficiently.

2. Objective

The primary objective of this implementation was to create visually appealing employee summary cards that display key analytics while maintaining consistency with the overall Odoo user interface.

3. Employee Summary Card Design

Each employee is represented by an individual analytics card containing essential information and work metrics.

Card Components
Employee Avatar
Employee Name
Department Information
Total Tasks
Pending Tasks
Active Tasks
Completed Tasks
Overdue Tasks
Leave Taken
4. User Interface Enhancements

The employee cards were designed using a modern card-based layout with attention to usability and readability.

Implemented Improvements
