5. Responsive Layout

The dashboard cards automatically adjust based on the available screen size.

Features
Responsive grid layout
Equal card dimensions
Consistent spacing between cards
Optimized display across different screen resolutions
6. Information Display

Each employee card presents important work statistics in a simplified format.

Displayed Metrics
Total Tasks – Total tasks assigned to the employee.
Pending Tasks – Tasks awaiting progress.
Active Tasks – Tasks currently in progress.
Completed Tasks – Successfully completed tasks.
Overdue Tasks – Tasks that have exceeded their due date.
Leave Taken – Number of leave days recorded.

This layout enables managers to quickly evaluate employee workload and productivity.

